anding on a palace terrace at night, warm lantern bokeh glowing behind her. Her long black hair is half-pinned with ornate golden tassel hairpieces, white jade teardrop earrings at her ears, wearing a cream-white cross-collar hanfu with gold floral embroidery at the collar. She begins with a bright, open smile; as the low, questioning opening phrase of the music enters, the smile slowly settles into calm, focused resolve and her warm brown eyes steady. A night wind stirs the loose strands at her temples and sets the golden tassels trembling. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward her face.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the camera cuts to a low-angle wide shot at the top of a long white-jade palace staircase rising above a sea of clouds, with thousands of amber lanterns glowing in the night city far below. <Subject 1> lifts her chin and walks upward with deliberate, unhurried steps; her wide sleeves, skirt, and flowing hair lift in the rising wind, the golden tassels swinging at her temples, while drifting cloud mist parts around her ankles as she ascends.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.500, the camera cuts to a low medium close-up from the front. <Subject 1> stops and raises her eyes to the far horizon with quiet, commanding ambition. A final gust blows a strand of hair across her cheek as the golden tassels sway and gradually settle. Amber lantern light catches her unwavering gaze, and the frame holds on her composed, determined face.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nNight wind sweeping across palace eaves and through cloud mist; the faint crystalline chime of golden tassel ornaments swaying; the soft rustle of hanfu silk sleeves and skirt in the wind; a very distant, hushed murmur of the city far below. No spoken words.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n<Audio 1> is directly reused as the complete audience-only music and vocal track for the full target video.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name"